# Prebuilt apps included in the ROM, all from the official F-Droid repository.
# Each APK keeps its original signature, so F-Droid can update it later.
#
# Columns: build module, package name, F-Droid version code, APK SHA-256.
# scripts/prepare-deps.sh downloads and verifies every active line before a build.
# To add an app, add "Module package - -" and run scripts/pin-apps.py.
#
# Module          Package                       VersionCode  SHA-256


